      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system protect my car during Delhi to Raipur transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp gently lowers the vehicle onto the enclosed carrier, eliminating manual lifting and reducing impact forces. Integrated wheel chocks and a 4‑wheel lock secure the car in place, while edge‑padding cushions vulnerable panels. This combination ensures a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
