        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are mandatory for RTO registration when moving a vehicle from Delhi to Raipur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must provide the original registration certificate, valid insurance copy, address proof for both origin and destination, a signed e‑Way bill, and the GST invoice from Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers. These documents enable smooth RTO transfer and eligibility for government reimbursement claims.</p>
