        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on vehicle size, distance (≈850 km), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling requirements. Transparent cost tables list base freight, fuel surcharge, GST, and optional services. There are no hidden toll or parking fees; all statutory charges are included in the quoted amount.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Delhi‑Raipur journey and what security measures are in place?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that provides live location updates via our client portal. Additionally, the carrier is monitored by 24/7 CCTV, and the vehicle is locked with a 4‑wheel lock and edge‑padding to prevent movement or damage throughout transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the door‑to‑door car transport from Delhi to Raipur typically take, and what factors can affect transit time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard door‑to‑door service averages 18‑22 hours, depending on traffic, weather, and toll processing. Peak holiday seasons or unexpected roadwork on NH‑19 can add a few hours. Our route‑optimization team monitors conditions in real time to minimize delays and keep you informed.</p>
