        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide full‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities. The policy guarantees reimbursement up to the declared value of your vehicle, with a fast claim process. Optional excess‑free coverage can be added at the time of booking.</p>
